@startuml
!include _style.puml

[*] --> Empty : page load

state Empty : suggestion chips shown
state Pending : "Thinking…" indicator\ninput and Send disabled
state Answered : answer rendered as Markdown\nwith de-duplicated source links
state Error : error-styled assistant message

Empty --> Pending : submit question /\nclick suggestion chip
Answered --> Pending : submit another question
Error --> Pending : user retries

Pending --> Answered : HTTP 200 { answer, sources }
Pending --> Error : network failure or non-2xx
Pending --> Pending : submission ignored (REQ-49)

Answered --> [*] : reload — history not persisted
Error --> [*] : reload — history not persisted

note right of Pending
  Concurrent requests are prevented:
  submissions while pending are
  ignored (REQ-49).
end note
@enduml
